1f04fa8e (1)(2).png", "id": "1793295041680481", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308699_1793295045013814_7185863093506872466_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7lVjzWIZr0gQ7kNvwG2zq7o&_nc_oc=AdquGGPR_tJZXyQOzYsaYaCH2qFPrf10m3sGI8gRSbM21JBs75RYhgUjDVMOLrOmMkE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG4Q5jqG7Z5qnJHH9npESlhrNgo6x-JCDsEV_B5DZCNsw&oe=6A91841A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "auraplay-cover-landscape-2560x1440-v2.png", "id": "1572402754640791", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_1572402761307457_5157960825411766997_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3ox_yXZnXCQQ7kNvwFM0WVJ&_nc_oc=Adp73iiO1TvJyA3YrSoe6zY8elUmPJ7NmJ3pYKeagMBoNNNcR0j4x-93l3gmbNwZUtg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHrBARpjfipNz7Z6ahqVBl4F4abao3wvVyZEfI8w5dO4A&oe=6A9182CA"}, "display_name": "AuraPlay VR Player", "keywords": ["cinema", "movies", "Plex", "3D", "streaming"], "long_description": "**Key Features:**\n\n**Stream from your NAS or PC (SMB & DLNA):** Play from a network share or media server (Plex, Universal Media Server) over Wi-Fi. Even heavy 4K & 8K files stay smooth - no stutter.\n\n**AuraLink Companion App:** One-click PC streaming and 2D to 3D conversion - free at auraplayvr.com.\n\n**Automatic Subtitles:** An .srt beside your film loads itself.\n\n**Flat or Curved Screen:** Size and place a giant display anywhere, then wrap it around you with Curved Screen mode.\n\n**Home Cinema & Luxury Auditorium:** Glide into any seat and watch on the big screen as the lights dim.\n\n**Lock the Screen:** Pin it so a stray nudge can't move it mid-film.\n\n**Plays Your Library:** MP4, MKV, AVI, MOV with native aspect ratios (4:3, 16:9, Scope), subtitles and auto-resume.\n\n**True 3D Cinema:** Side-by-Side and Over-Under with sharp, strain-free depth.\n\n**Immersive 180\u00b0 & 360\u00b0 VR Video:** Step inside your own 180\u00b0 and 360\u00b0 videos. Auto-detects the format from the filename, with Flat / 180\u00b0 / 360\u00b0 controls, one-tap Re-center, and full 3D (Side-by-Side & Over-Under) support.\n\n**Reactive AuraLight:** Ambient room glow that samples the film's colours in real time; adjustable Room Illumination.\n\n**Spatial Audio:** Sound stays locked to the screen as you turn your head - a true cinema feel.\n\n**Spatial UI:** Grab and float controls anywhere, with auto-fading playback bars.\n\n**True Mute:** Silence audio in screen recordings for clean, copyright-safe clips.\n\nNo subscriptions. No accounts. No telemetry. Tap \"Play Sample\" to see it in action!", "short_description": "Your movies deserve a cinema, not a flat rectangle. AuraPlay turns your headset into a spatial theatre - a screen as big as you want, floating in your real room or inside custom 3D environments. Built natively for Meta Quest 3 & 3S: lean and fast for your whole 2D and 3D collection.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://auraplayvr.com/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "David McGuinness", "support_website_url": "https://auraplayvr.com/#support", "website_url": "https://auraplayvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "2120799152185142"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri":